# Build context for the Containerfile: an allowlist, because the risk runs the other
# way. The working tree holds appsettings.json and mcp.json with live keys, TODO.md,
# seeds and runs; a denylist forgets one of them the day it appears. Only what
# `dotnet publish nb.csproj` reads gets in. Docker and podman both honour this file.
*
!nb.csproj
!Directory.Build.props
!Program.cs
!AssemblyInfo.cs
!nb.ico
!appsettings.example.json
!theme.json
!LICENSE.txt
!THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
!prompts/
!nb.Core/
!Providers/
**/bin/
**/obj/
